---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Welcome to Petrobolos Games. Discover our worlds and latest news.
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 py-10 sm:py-14">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-20 left-1/2 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-20 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/15 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
      <img
        src="{{ featured.background }}"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950/90 via-slate-900/75 to-slate-900/90"></div>

      <div class="relative grid gap-8 px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:py-16">
        <div>
          <p class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200">
            Featured Project
          </p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">{{ featured.title }}</h1>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-slate-200">{{ featured.subtitle }}</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-300">
            {{ featured.description }}
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href="{{ featured.url }}"
              class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-primary-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-primary-500"
            >
              Explore {{ featured.title }}
            </a>
            <a
              href="/games/"
              class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-white/30 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10"
            >
              View All Projects
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <img
              src="{{ featured.image }}"
              alt="{{ featured.title }} artwork"
              class="mx-auto w-64 object-contain"
            >
            <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-center text-xs">
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 text-slate-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-white">Platforms</p>
                <p>{{ platforms | length }}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 text-slate-200">
                <p class="font-semibold text-white">Expected Release</p>
                <p>{{ featured.releaseDate }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 md:text-3xl dark:text-white">Current Projects</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Three focused productions in active development.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/games/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800 dark:text-primary-300">Browse project pages<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    {% for game in games %}
    <article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
        <img src="{{ game.image }}" alt="{{ game.title }} key art" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
      </div>
      <div class="p-5">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300">{{ game.subtitle }}</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">{{ game.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 line-clamp-3 dark:text-slate-300">{{ game.description }}</p>
        <div class="mt-5">
          <a href="{{ game.url }}" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800 dark:text-primary-300">Open project<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Studio Snapshot</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        Petrobolos Games builds tightly scoped worlds with expressive art direction and platform-ready production pipelines.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>Story-driven experiences designed for replayability.</li>
        <li>Cross-disciplinary team spanning design, engineering, and art.</li>
        <li>Roadmap tailored for PC, console, and mobile audiences.</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/about/" class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800 dark:text-primary-300">Meet the studio<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
    </article>

    <article id="latest" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">From the Workshop</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">A quick look at what’s moving this quarter.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800/60">
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">A Dog Tale: Vertical slice polish</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Narrative pacing, traversal tuning, and controller iteration are underway.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800/60">
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Platform readiness pass</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Store setup, build automation, and platform submission prep in progress.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact/" class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800 dark:text-primary-300">Contact the team<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
